{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Being The Game",
    "steam_appid": 2390420,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390420/extras/5fa9c279688d29f9fcb6cc9bfeae4136.poster.avif?t=1704497277\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390420/extras/5fa9c279688d29f9fcb6cc9bfeae4136.webm?t=1704497277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390420/extras/5fa9c279688d29f9fcb6cc9bfeae4136.mp4?t=1704497277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>My name is Maksim, and I've always dreamed of creating my own game and bringing bold and creative ideas to life. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390420/extras/72aad7ae0eda0fb29df521bb0458bc62.poster.avif?t=1704497277\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390420/extras/72aad7ae0eda0fb29df521bb0458bc62.webm?t=1704497277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390420/extras/72aad7ae0eda0fb29df521bb0458bc62.mp4?t=1704497277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>I want to express my gratitude to everyone who took the time to check out my page, as well as to everyone who supports indie developers, adds the game to favorites, buys it and leaves reviews. This is really important to me and I appreciate your support.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390420/extras/f051b4c6c730c50749337c3e3e5d2ac5.avif?t=1704497277\" /></span><br>My game tells the story of a warrior stuck for an eternity in a dark dimension. He needs to gather enough Time to open a portal from his dungeon and return to his time and home. Players will explore new dimensions, traverse the secret paths of the empire's astral caravans, and face dangers in the lands of orcs and ogres. <br>Do you want to know more? <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390420/extras/1600e1219689bae34af5ad7290cdbe66.avif?t=1704497277\" /></span><br>In the game, you can siege fortresses, climb over walls, break them or even fly over them.<br><br>Players will also be able to assemble a squad from different races, cultures and species, including knights, giants, mechanical warriors and soldiers who have risen from the graves.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390420/extras/3b271828fbd2ba6f8f8c13386b6b15dd.avif?t=1704497277\" /></span><br>I believe that the game will be interesting and exciting.<br><br><i>Think about the game, create it, become it. Thank you for your support.<br>-Maksim</i>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390420/extras/5fa9c279688d29f9fcb6cc9bfeae4136.poster.avif?t=1704497277\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390420/extras/5fa9c279688d29f9fcb6cc9bfeae4136.webm?t=1704497277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390420/extras/5fa9c279688d29f9fcb6cc9bfeae4136.mp4?t=1704497277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>My name is Maksim, and I've always dreamed of creating my own game and bringing bold and creative ideas to life. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390420/extras/72aad7ae0eda0fb29df521bb0458bc62.poster.avif?t=1704497277\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390420/extras/72aad7ae0eda0fb29df521bb0458bc62.webm?t=1704497277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390420/extras/72aad7ae0eda0fb29df521bb0458bc62.mp4?t=1704497277\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>I want to express my gratitude to everyone who took the time to check out my page, as well as to everyone who supports indie developers, adds the game to favorites, buys it and leaves reviews. This is really important to me and I appreciate your support.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390420/extras/f051b4c6c730c50749337c3e3e5d2ac5.avif?t=1704497277\" /></span><br>My game tells the story of a warrior stuck for an eternity in a dark dimension. He needs to gather enough Time to open a portal from his dungeon and return to his time and home. Players will explore new dimensions, traverse the secret paths of the empire's astral caravans, and face dangers in the lands of orcs and ogres. <br>Do you want to know more? <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390420/extras/1600e1219689bae34af5ad7290cdbe66.avif?t=1704497277\" /></span><br>In the game, you can siege fortresses, climb over walls, break them or even fly over them.<br><br>Players will also be able to assemble a squad from different races, cultures and species, including knights, giants, mechanical warriors and soldiers who have risen from the graves.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390420/extras/3b271828fbd2ba6f8f8c13386b6b15dd.avif?t=1704497277\" /></span><br>I believe that the game will be interesting and exciting.<br><br><i>Think about the game, create it, become it. Thank you for your support.<br>-Maksim</i>",
    "short_description": "Explore a vast open world, hack and slash enemies, assemble a squad from different races and cultures, and complete quests in this solo-developed action RPG game. Will you collect enough Time to return home?",
    "supported_languages": "English, Russian, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Turkish, Japanese",
